		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Rotten, moldering, undead mud-spirit manifested from soil sprinkled with killer's ashes.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 12, <strong>HP</strong> 25, <strong>ATK</strong> 3 slam +4 (1d6 + misfortune), <strong>MV</strong> near (burrow), <strong>S</strong> +3, <strong>D</strong> +2, <strong>C</strong> +3, <strong>I</strong> +0, <strong>W</strong> +2, <strong>Ch</strong> +3, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 5</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Broken Ground</strong>. A near-sized area around the guecubu is churned, muddy, and difficult to move through.</p><p></p><p><strong>Greater Undead</strong>. Immune to morale checks. Only damaged by silver or magical sources.</p><p></p><p><strong>Misfortune</strong>. Mortals within near, CHA 15+ or cursed with bad luck, rolling checks and attacks with DISADV for 1d4 rounds. Beings with luck tokens are unaffected by misfortune.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
